{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25928","headline":"怀仙二首 一 · 鲍溶","name":"怀仙二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崑仑九层台，台上宫城峻。\n西母持地图，东来献虞舜。\n虞宫礼成後，回驾仙风顺。\n十二楼上人，笙歌沸天引。\n裴回扶桑路，白日生离恨。\n青鸟更不来，麻姑断书信。\n乃知东海水，清浅谁能问。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}